    "howto": "With empty hands: form a mat, drain its mesh, couch it onto the press bed, press it, and lift one wet sheet onto the output shelf. Take that sheet before the next lift. Each sheet retains 10 g fibre and 20 g water; the tray keeps the other 380 g water. Stocks supply three sheets. This is pressed wet material, with no drying step."
